--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository. It does not cover
the datasets the builders download, which keep their own terms:

  swj0419/WikiMIA              MIT. The extracted item files under
                               experiments/data/ are redistributed here.

  monology/pile-uncopyrighted  Mixed upstream terms ("license: other").
                               Extracted items are NOT redistributed here;
                               src/build_itemsets.py rebuilds them from the
                               pinned revision.

  openai/gsm8k                 MIT.

  Scale AI GSM1k               Released under access conditions. Not
                               redistributed, and not obtainable through
                               this repository. See Zhang et al. (2024).
